se, especially extended limbs. All poses SAME pixels per body length, do not scale collapse poses up.\nPyre Warden: two legs and two arms, shield SCREEN LEFT, claw gauntlet SCREEN RIGHT, horned helmet and furnace chest. Action is guarding support: brace legs and lift shield, present shield forward and spread claw hand, settle shield, recover. Idle small upper-body breathing and flame shape pulse, feet motionless.\nEach silhouette at most 65% cell width with wide EMPTY gutters.",
